1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,504
Speaking, task one. Topic 15: Shopping. Ten questions. Listen to the question and answer out loud.

2
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,447
Where do you shop?

3
00:00:17,833 --> 00:00:20,037
I shop at a supermarket near my home.

4
00:00:20,933 --> 00:00:22,503
How often do you shop?

5
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:30,555
I do a big shop once a week, on Saturday.

6
00:00:31,467 --> 00:00:32,992
What do you buy most often?

7
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:42,245
Most often I buy bread, milk, fruit and vegetables.

8
00:00:43,133 --> 00:00:45,170
Do you pay by card or cash?

9
00:00:50,567 --> 00:00:53,299
Mostly I pay by card, it's faster.

10
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:55,782
Do you shop online?

11
00:01:01,167 --> 00:01:04,593
Yes, I buy clothes and electronics online.

12
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:07,260
Who does the shopping in your home?

13
00:01:12,667 --> 00:01:15,648
My wife and I shop together, I carry the bags.

14
00:01:16,533 --> 00:01:18,167
What did you buy last?

15
00:01:23,567 --> 00:01:25,794
Last I bought new winter boots.

16
00:01:26,700 --> 00:01:28,163
How much did you pay for them?

17
00:01:33,567 --> 00:01:37,550
I paid one thousand two hundred crowns, they were on sale.

18
00:01:38,467 --> 00:01:40,238
What will you buy this week?

19
00:01:45,633 --> 00:01:48,067
This week I'll buy a present for my daughter.

20
00:01:48,967 --> 00:01:51,378
What would you buy if you had a lot of money?

21
00:01:56,767 --> 00:01:59,214
I would buy a new car and a big flat.

22
00:02:00,100 --> 00:02:09,748
Great! Practise topic 15 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
